css34: core.cfg without options that do nothing on episode1

- FollowCSGOServerGuidelines: every reader (core HalfLife2, sdktools) is
  under SOURCE_ENGINE == SE_CSGO; on episode1 nothing parses or checks it.
- SteamAuthstringValidation: PlayerManager parses it, but its only check,
  CPlayer::IsAuthStringValidated, is under SOURCE_ENGINE >= SE_ORANGEBOX and
  returns true on episode1 (the v34 engine has no IsClientFullyAuthenticated).
  Admins are matched by the engine's auth string either way.

Code is unchanged: an old core.cfg that still has either key loads as before.

